<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/820> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Economic Sciences 2004, Finn E. Kydland" .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/820> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/year> "2004"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/820> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/contribution> "Showed that economic policies are often plagued by problems of time inconsistency. Demonstrated that society could gain from prior commitment to economic policy. Introduced new ideas about economic policy design and the driving forces behind business cycles."@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/820> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/Award> .
