<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/841> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/contribution> "Deepened our understanding of the relation between short-run and long-run effects of macroeconomic policy."@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/841> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/Award> .
