<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/854> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/contribution> "The pioneer in the field of mechanism design.  Formulated a general mathematical framework for analyzing institutions implementing collective decision making. "@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/854> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/Award> .
