<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/1> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of the extraordinary services he has rendered by the discovery of the remarkable rays subsequently named after him\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/1> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"s\u00E5som ett erk\u00E4nnande av den utomordentliga f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nst han inlagt genom uppt\u00E4ckten av de egendomliga str\u00E5lar, som sedermera uppkallats efter honom\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/2> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of the extraordinary service they rendered by their researches into the influence of magnetism upon radiation phenomena\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/2> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"s\u00E5som ett erk\u00E4nnande av den utomordentliga f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nst de inlagt genom sina unders\u00F6kningar \u00F6ver magnetismens inflytande p\u00E5 str\u00E5lningsfenomenen\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/3> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of the extraordinary service they rendered by their researches into the influence of magnetism upon radiation phenomena\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/3> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"s\u00E5som ett erk\u00E4nnande av den utomordentliga f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nst de inlagt genom sina unders\u00F6kningar \u00F6ver magnetismens inflytande p\u00E5 str\u00E5lningsfenomenen\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/4> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of the extraordinary services he has rendered by his discovery of spontaneous radioactivity\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/4> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"s\u00E5som ett erk\u00E4nnande av den utomordentliga f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nst han inlagt genom uppt\u00E4ckten av den spontana radioaktiviteten\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/5> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of the extraordinary services they have rendered by their joint researches on the radiation phenomena discovered by Professor Henri Becquerel\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/5> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"s\u00E5som ett erk\u00E4nnande av den utomordentliga f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nst de inlagt genom sina gemensamt utf\u00F6rda arbeten r\u00F6rande de av Professor Henri Becquerel uppt\u00E4ckta str\u00E5lningsfenomenen\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/6> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of the extraordinary services they have rendered by their joint researches on the radiation phenomena discovered by Professor Henri Becquerel\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/6> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"s\u00E5som ett erk\u00E4nnande av den utomordentliga f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nst de inlagt genom sina gemensamt utf\u00F6rda arbeten r\u00F6rande de av Professor Henri Becquerel uppt\u00E4ckta str\u00E5lningsfenomenen\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/7> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his investigations of the densities of the most important gases and for his discovery of argon in connection with these studies\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/7> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans unders\u00F6kningar r\u00F6rande de viktigaste gasernas t\u00E4thet samt hans i sammanhang med dessa unders\u00F6kningar gjorda uppt\u00E4ckt av argon\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/8> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his work on cathode rays\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/8> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans arbeten \u00F6ver katodstr\u00E5larna\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/9> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of the great merits of his theoretical and experimental investigations on the conduction of electricity by gases\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/9> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"s\u00E5som ett erk\u00E4nnande av den stora f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nst han inlagt genom sina teoretiska och experimentella unders\u00F6kningar \u00F6ver elektricitetens g\u00E5ng genom gaser\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/10> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his optical precision instruments and the spectroscopic and metrological investigations carried out with their aid\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/10> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans optiska precisionsinstrument och hans d\u00E4rmed utf\u00F6rda spektroskopiska och metrologiska unders\u00F6kningar\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/11> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his method of reproducing colours photographically based on the phenomenon of interference\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/11> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans p\u00E5 interferensfenomenet grundade metod att fotografiskt \u00E5tergiva f\u00E4rger\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/12> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of their contributions to the development of wireless telegraphy\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/12> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"s\u00E5som ett erk\u00E4nnande av deras f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nster om den tr\u00E5dl\u00F6sa telegrafiens utveckling\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/13> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of their contributions to the development of wireless telegraphy\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/13> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"s\u00E5som ett erk\u00E4nnande av deras f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nster om den tr\u00E5dl\u00F6sa telegrafiens utveckling\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/14> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his work on the equation of state for gases and liquids\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/14> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans arbeten ang\u00E5ende gasers och v\u00E4tskors tillst\u00E5ndsekvation\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/15> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his discoveries regarding the laws governing the radiation of heat\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/15> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans uppt\u00E4ckter ang\u00E5ende v\u00E4rmestr\u00E5lningens lagar\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/16> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his invention of automatic regulators for use in conjunction with gas accumulators for illuminating lighthouses and buoys\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/16> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans uppfinningar av sj\u00E4lvverkande regulatorer att i kombination med gasaccumulatorer anv\u00E4ndas till belysning av fyrar och lysbojar\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/17> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his investigations on the properties of matter at low temperatures which led, inter alia, to the production of liquid helium\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/17> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"i anledning av hans unders\u00F6kningar \u00F6ver kroppars egenskaper vid l\u00E5ga temperaturer, vilka bland annat lett till framst\u00E4llningen av flytande helium\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/18> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his discovery of the diffraction of X-rays by crystals\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/18> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans uppt\u00E4ckt av r\u00F6ntgenstr\u00E5larnas diffraktion i kristaller\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/19> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for their services in the analysis of crystal structure by means of X-rays\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/19> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r deras f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nster om utforskandet av kristallstrukturer medelst r\u00F6ntgenstr\u00E5lar\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/20> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for their services in the analysis of crystal structure by means of X-rays\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/20> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r deras f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nster om utforskandet av kristallstrukturer medelst r\u00F6ntgenstr\u00E5lar\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/21> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his discovery of the characteristic R&ouml;ntgen radiation of the elements\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/21> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans uppt\u00E4ckt av den karakteristiska r\u00F6ntgenstr\u00E5lningen hos elementen\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/22> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of the services he rendered to the advancement of Physics by his discovery of energy quanta\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/22> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"s\u00E5som ett erk\u00E4nnande av den f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nst han genom uppt\u00E4ckten av elementarkvanta inlagt om fysikens utveckling\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/23> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his discovery of the Doppler effect in canal rays and the splitting of spectral lines in electric fields\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/23> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans uppt\u00E4ckt av dopplereffekten hos kanalstr\u00E5lar och av spektrallinjers uppdelning i elektriska f\u00E4lt\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/24> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of the service he has rendered to precision measurements in Physics by his discovery of anomalies in nickel steel alloys\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/24> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"s\u00E5som ett erk\u00E4nnande av den f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nst han genom uppt\u00E4ckten av nickelst\u00E5llegeringarnas anomalier inlagt om precisionsfysiken\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/25> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his services to Theoretical Physics, and especially for his discovery of the law of the photoelectric effect\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/25> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nster om den teoretiska fysiken, s\u00E4rskilt hans uppt\u00E4ckt av lagen f\u00F6r den fotoelektriska effekten\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/26> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his services in the investigation of the structure of atoms and of the radiation emanating from them\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/26> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nster om utforskandet av atomernas struktur och den fr\u00E5n dem utg\u00E5ende str\u00E5lningen\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/27> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his work on the elementary charge of electricity and on the photoelectric effect\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/27> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans arbeten r\u00F6rande den elektriska enhetsladdningen samt den fotoelektriska effekten\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/28> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his discoveries and research in the field of X-ray spectroscopy\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/28> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans r\u00F6ntgenspektroskopiska uppt\u00E4ckter och forskningar\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/29> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for their discovery of the laws governing the impact of an electron upon an atom\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/29> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"med anledning av deras uppt\u00E4ckt av lagarna f\u00F6r st\u00F6ten mellan en elektron och en atom\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/30> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for their discovery of the laws governing the impact of an electron upon an atom\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/30> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"med anledning av deras uppt\u00E4ckt av lagarna f\u00F6r st\u00F6ten mellan en elektron och en atom\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/31> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his work on the discontinuous structure of matter, and especially for his discovery of sedimentation equilibrium\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/31> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans arbeten r\u00F6rande materiens diskontinuerliga struktur, s\u00E4rskilt f\u00F6r hans uppt\u00E4ckt av sedimentationsj\u00E4mvikten\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/32> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his discovery of the effect named after him\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/32> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans uppt\u00E4ckt av den efter honom ben\u00E4mnda effekten\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/33> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his method of making the paths of electrically charged particles visible by condensation of vapour\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/33> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r uppt\u00E4ckten av hans metod att genom \u00E5ngkondensation g\u00F6ra elektriskt laddade partiklars banor iakttagbara\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/34> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his work on the thermionic phenomenon and especially for the discovery of the law named after him\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/34> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans arbeten r\u00F6rande termjonfenomenet och s\u00E4rskilt f\u00F6r uppt\u00E4ckten av den efter honom ben\u00E4mnda lagen\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/35> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his discovery of the wave nature of electrons\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/35> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r uppt\u00E4ckten av elektronernas v\u00E5gnatur\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/36> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his work on the scattering of light and for the discovery of the effect named after him\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/36> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans arbeten ang\u00E5ende ljusets diffusion och f\u00F6r uppt\u00E4ckten av den efter honom uppkallade effekten\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/37> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for the creation of quantum mechanics, the application of which has, inter alia, led to the discovery of the allotropic forms of hydrogen\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/37> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r uppst\u00E4llande av kvantmekaniken, vars anv\u00E4ndning bl.a. lett till uppt\u00E4ckten av v\u00E4tets allotropa former\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/38> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for the discovery of new productive forms of atomic theory\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/38> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r uppt\u00E4ckandet av nya fruktb\u00E4rande former av atomteorien\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/39> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for the discovery of new productive forms of atomic theory\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/39> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r uppt\u00E4ckandet av nya fruktb\u00E4rande former av atomteorien\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/40> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for the discovery of the neutron\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/40> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r uppt\u00E4ckten av neutronen\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/41> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his discovery of cosmic radiation\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/41> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r uppt\u00E4ckten av den kosmiska str\u00E5lningen\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/42> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his discovery of the positron\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/42> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r uppt\u00E4ckten av positronen\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/43> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for their experimental discovery of the diffraction of electrons by crystals\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/43> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r den experimentella uppt\u00E4ckten av interferensfenomenet vid kristallers bestr\u00E5lning med elektroner\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/44> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for their experimental discovery of the diffraction of electrons by crystals\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/44> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r den experimentella uppt\u00E4ckten av interferensfenomenet vid kristallers bestr\u00E5lning med elektroner\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/45> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his demonstrations of the existence of new radioactive elements produced by neutron irradiation, and for his related discovery of nuclear reactions brought about by slow neutrons\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/45> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans p\u00E5visande av nya radioaktiva grund\u00E4mnen, framst\u00E4llda genom neutronbestr\u00E5lning, och hans i anslutning d\u00E4rtill gjorda uppt\u00E4ckt av k\u00E4rnreaktioner, \u00E5stadkomna genom l\u00E5ngsamma neutroner\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/46> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for the invention and development of the cyclotron and for results obtained with it, especially with regard to artificial radioactive elements\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/46> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r uppfinningen av cyklotronen, dess utveckling och med densamma vunna resultat, s\u00E4rskilt betr\u00E4ffande artificiellt radioaktiva element\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/47> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his contribution to the development of the molecular ray method and his discovery of the magnetic moment of the proton\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/47> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans bidrag till utveckling av molekylstr\u00E5lemetoden och uppt\u00E4ckten av protonens magnetiska moment\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/48> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his resonance method for recording the magnetic properties of atomic nuclei\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/48> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r den av honom angivna resonansmetoden f\u00F6r registrering av atomk\u00E4rnans magnetiska egenskaper\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/49> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for the discovery of the Exclusion Principle, also called the Pauli Principle\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/49> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r uppt\u00E4ckten av uteslutningsprincipen, \u00E4ven ben\u00E4mnd Pauliprincipen\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/50> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for the invention of an apparatus to produce extremely high pressures, and for the discoveries he made therewith in the field of high pressure physics\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/50> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r uppfinningen av en apparatur f\u00F6r \u00E5stadkommande av extremt h\u00F6ga tryck f\u00F6r de uppt\u00E4ckter han med densamma gjort inom omr\u00E5det f\u00F6r de h\u00F6ga tryckens fysik\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/51> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his investigations of the physics of the upper atmosphere especially for the discovery of the so-called Appleton layer\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/52> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his development of the Wilson cloud chamber method, and his discoveries therewith in the fields of nuclear physics and cosmic radiation\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/52> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans utveckling av Wilsonmetoden och hans d\u00E4rmed gjorda uppt\u00E4ckter inom k\u00E4rnfysiken och r\u00F6rande den kosmiska str\u00E5lningen\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/53> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his prediction of the existence of mesons on the basis of theoretical work on nuclear forces\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/53> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans p\u00E5 grundval av teoretiska arbeten r\u00F6rande k\u00E4rnkrafterna gjorda f\u00F6ruts\u00E4gelse av mesonernas existens\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/54> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his development of the photographic method of studying nuclear processes and his discoveries regarding mesons made with this method\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/54> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans utveckling av den fotografiska metoden f\u00F6r studiet av k\u00E4rnprocesser och hans d\u00E4rvid gjorda uppt\u00E4ckter r\u00F6rande mesonerna\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/55> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for their pioneer work on the transmutation of atomic nuclei by artificially accelerated atomic particles\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/55> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r deras pionj\u00E4rarbete vid genomf\u00F6randet av k\u00E4rnomvandlingar medelst artificiellt accelererade partiklar\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/56> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for their pioneer work on the transmutation of atomic nuclei by artificially accelerated atomic particles\""@en .
