<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/57> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for their development of new methods for nuclear magnetic precision measurements and discoveries in connection therewith\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/57> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r deras utveckling av nya metoder f\u00F6r k\u00E4rnmagnetiska precisionsm\u00E4tningar och d\u00E4rmed gjorda uppt\u00E4ckter\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/58> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for their development of new methods for nuclear magnetic precision measurements and discoveries in connection therewith\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/58> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r deras utveckling av nya metoder f\u00F6r k\u00E4rnmagnetiska precisionsm\u00E4tningar och d\u00E4rmed gjorda uppt\u00E4ckter\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/59> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his demonstration of the phase contrast method, especially for his invention of the phase contrast microscope\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/59> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r den av honom angivna faskontrastmetoden, s\u00E4rskilt f\u00F6r hans uppfinning av faskontrastmikroskopet\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/60> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his fundamental research in quantum mechanics, especially for his statistical interpretation of the wavefunction\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/60> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans grundl\u00E4ggande arbeten inom kvantmekaniken, s\u00E4rskilt hans statistiska tolkning av v\u00E5gfunktionen\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/61> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for the coincidence method and his discoveries made therewith\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/61> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r koincidensmetoden och hans d\u00E4rmed gjorda uppt\u00E4ckter\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/62> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his discoveries concerning the fine structure of the hydrogen spectrum\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/62> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans uppt\u00E4ckter r\u00F6rande finstrukturen i v\u00E4tets spektrum\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/63> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his precision determination of the magnetic moment of the electron\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/63> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans precisionsbest\u00E4mning av elektronens magnetiska moment\""@sv .
