<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/71> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r deras uppt\u00E4ckt av antiprotonen\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/72> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for their discovery of the antiproton\""@en .
