<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/1001> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r teoretiska uppt\u00E4ckter av topologiska fas\u00F6verg\u00E5ngar och topologiska materiefaser\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/159> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of the extraordinary services he has rendered by the discovery of the laws of chemical dynamics and osmotic pressure in solutions\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/159> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"s\u00E5som ett erk\u00E4nnande av den utomordentliga f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nst han inlagt genom uppt\u00E4ckten av lagarna f\u00F6r den kemiska dynamiken och f\u00F6r det osmotiska trycket i l\u00F6sningar\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/160> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of the extraordinary services he has rendered by his work on sugar and purine syntheses\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/160> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"s\u00E5som ett erk\u00E4nnande av den utomordentliga f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nst han inlagt genom sina syntetiska arbeten inom socker - och purin-grupperna\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/161> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of the extraordinary services he has rendered to the advancement of chemistry by his electrolytic theory of dissociation\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/161> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"s\u00E5som ett erk\u00E4nnande f\u00F6r den utomordentliga f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nst han genom sin elektrolytiska dissociations-teori inlagt om kemiens utveckling\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/162> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of his services in the discovery of the inert gaseous elements in air, and his determination of their place in the periodic system\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/162> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"s\u00E5som ett erk\u00E4nnande av den f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nst han inlagt genom uppt\u00E4ckten av de indifferenta gasformiga grund\u00E4mnenena i luften och best\u00E4mmandet av deras plats i det periodiska systemet\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/163> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of his services in the advancement of organic chemistry and the chemical industry, through his work on organic dyes and hydroaromatic compounds\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/163> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"s\u00E5som ett erk\u00E4nnande av den f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nst han inlagt om den organiska kemiens och den kemiska industriens utveckling genom sina arbeten r\u00F6rande organiska f\u00E4rg\u00E4mnen och hydroaromatiska f\u00F6reningar\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/164> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of the great services rendered by him in his investigation and isolation of the element fluorine, and for the adoption in the service of science of the electric furnace called after him\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/164> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"s\u00E5som ett erk\u00E4nnande av den stora f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nst han inlagt genom sin unders\u00F6kning och isolering av elementet fluor samt genom inf\u00F6randet av den efter honom uppkallade elektriska ugnen i vetenskapens tj\u00E4nst\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/165> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his biochemical researches and his discovery of cell-free fermentation\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/165> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans biologiskkemiska unders\u00F6kningar och uppt\u00E4ckt av den cellfria j\u00E4sningen\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/166> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his investigations into the disintegration of the elements, and the chemistry of radioactive substances\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/166> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans unders\u00F6kningar r\u00F6rande elementers s\u00F6nderfallande och de radioaktiva \u00E4mnenenas kemi\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/167> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of his work on catalysis and for his investigations into the fundamental principles governing chemical equilibria and rates of reaction\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/167> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"s\u00E5som ett erk\u00E4nnande \u00E5t hans arbeten \u00F6ver katalys j\u00E4mte hans h\u00E4rf\u00F6r grundl\u00E4ggande unders\u00F6kningar \u00F6ver kemiska j\u00E4mviktsf\u00F6rh\u00E5llanden och reaktionshastigheter\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/168> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of his services to organic chemistry and the chemical industry by his pioneer work in the field of alicyclic compounds\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/168> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"s\u00E5som ett erk\u00E4nnande av den f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nst han inlagt om den organiska kemiens och den kemiska industriens utveckling genom sina banbrytande arbeten p\u00E5 de alicykliska f\u00F6reningarnas omr\u00E5de\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/169> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of her services to the advancement of chemistry by the discovery of the elements radium and polonium, by the isolation of radium and the study of the nature and compounds of this remarkable element\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/169> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"s\u00E5som ett erk\u00E4nnande f\u00F6r den f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nst hon inlagt om kemiens utveckling genom uppt\u00E4ckten av grund\u00E4mnena radium och polonium, genom karakteriserandet av radium och dess isolerande i metalliskt tillst\u00E5nd samt genom sina unders\u00F6kningar ang\u00E5ende detta m\u00E4rkliga grund\u00E4mnes f\u00F6reningar\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/170> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for the discovery of the so-called Grignard reagent, which in recent years has greatly advanced the progress of organic chemistry\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/171> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his method of hydrogenating organic compounds in the presence of finely disintegrated metals whereby the progress of organic chemistry has been greatly advanced in recent years\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/171> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans metod att hydrera organiska f\u00F6reningar vid n\u00E4rvaro av fint f\u00F6rdelade metaller, varigenom den organiska kemiens framsteg under de senare \u00E5ren i h\u00F6g grad fr\u00E4mjats\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/172> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of his work on the linkage of atoms in molecules by which he has thrown new light on earlier investigations and opened up new fields of research especially in inorganic chemistry\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/172> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"p\u00E5 grund av hans arbeten ang\u00E5ende atomernas bindningsf\u00F6rh\u00E5llanden inom molekylen, varigenom han belyst \u00E4ldre och \u00F6ppnat nya forskningsomr\u00E5den, s\u00E4rskilt inom den oorganiska kemien\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/173> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of his accurate determinations of the atomic weight of a large number of chemical elements\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/173> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"s\u00E5som ett erk\u00E4nnande f\u00F6r hans noggranna best\u00E4mmningar av ett stort antal kemiska grund\u00E4mnens atomvikter\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/174> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his researches on plant pigments, especially chlorophyll\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/174> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans unders\u00F6kningar av f\u00E4rg\u00E4mnen i v\u00E4xtriket, framf\u00F6rallt klorofyll\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/175> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for the synthesis of ammonia from its elements\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/175> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans syntes av ammoniak ur dess element\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/176> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of his work in thermochemistry\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/176> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"s\u00E5som ett erk\u00E4nnande f\u00F6r hans termokemiska arbeten\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/177> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his contributions to our knowledge of the chemistry of radioactive substances, and his investigations into the origin and nature of isotopes\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/177> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans bidrag till k\u00E4nnedom om de radioaktiva \u00E4mnenas kemi och hans unders\u00F6kningar r\u00F6rande isotopers f\u00F6rekomst och natur\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/178> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his discovery, by means of his mass spectrograph, of isotopes, in a large number of non-radioactive elements, and for his enunciation of the whole-number rule\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/178> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans medelst masspektrografen gjorda uppt\u00E4ckt av ett stort antal ej radioaktiva grund\u00E4mnens isotopif\u00F6rh\u00E5llanden samt av den s.k. heltalslagen\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/179> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his invention of the method of micro-analysis of organic substances\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/179> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r den av honom uppfunna mikroanalysen av organiska \u00E4mnen\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/180> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his demonstration of the heterogenous nature of colloid solutions and for the methods he used, which have since become fundamental in modern colloid chemistry\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/180> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r uppvisandet av de kolloida l\u00F6sningarnas heterogena natur och f\u00F6r de d\u00E4rvid anv\u00E4nda metoderna, som varit grundl\u00E4ggande f\u00F6r den moderna kolloidkemien\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/181> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his work on disperse systems\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/181> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans arbeten r\u00F6rande dispersa system\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/182> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his investigations of the constitution of the bile acids and related substances\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/182> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans unders\u00F6kningar \u00F6ver gallsyrornas och n\u00E4rsl\u00E4ktade \u00E4mnens konstitution\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/183> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for the services rendered through his research into the constitution of the sterols and their connection with the vitamins\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/183> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nster om utforskandet av sterinernas konstitution och deras samband med vitamingruppen\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/184> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for their investigations on the fermentation of sugar and fermentative enzymes\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/184> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r deras unders\u00F6kningar av sockerarters j\u00E4sning och d\u00E4rvid verksamma enzym\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/185> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for their investigations on the fermentation of sugar and fermentative enzymes\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/185> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r deras unders\u00F6kningar av sockerarters j\u00E4sning och d\u00E4rvid verksamma enzym\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/186> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his researches into the constitution of haemin and chlorophyll and especially for his synthesis of haemin\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/186> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans arbeten \u00F6ver blad - och blodf\u00E4rg\u00E4menenas konstitution samt f\u00F6r hans syntes av h\u00E4min\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/187> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of their contributions to the invention and development of chemical high pressure methods\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/187> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r deras f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nster om kemiska h\u00F6gtrycksmetoders uppkomst och utveckling\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/188> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of their contributions to the invention and development of chemical high pressure methods\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/188> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r deras f\u00F6rtj\u00E4nster om kemiska h\u00F6gtrycksmetoders uppkomst och utveckling\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/189> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his discoveries and investigations in surface chemistry\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/189> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r hans uppt\u00E4ckter och unders\u00F6kningar inom ytkemien\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/190> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his discovery of heavy hydrogen\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/190> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r uppt\u00E4ckten av det tunga v\u00E4tet\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/191> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of their synthesis of new radioactive elements\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/191> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"s\u00E5som ett erk\u00E4nnande f\u00F6r deras gemensamt utf\u00F6rda syntes av nya radioaktiva grund\u00E4mnen\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/192> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"in recognition of their synthesis of new radioactive elements\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/192> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"s\u00E5som ett erk\u00E4nnande f\u00F6r deras gemensamt utf\u00F6rda syntes av nya radioaktiva grund\u00E4mnen\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/193> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his contributions to our knowledge of molecular structure through his investigations on dipole moments and on the diffraction of X-rays and electrons in gases\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/193> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"f\u00F6r de bidrag, som han genom sina unders\u00F6kningar \u00F6ver dipolmoment och \u00F6ver r\u00F6ntgen och elektronstr\u00E5leinterferens i gaser l\u00E4mnat till k\u00E4nnedom om molekylernas byggnad\""@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/194> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his investigations on carbohydrates and vitamin C\""@en .
