<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/563> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\u201Dfor organisasjonens banebrytande humanit\u00E6re innsats p\u00E5 flere kontinenter\u201D"@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/762> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his work for democracy and human rights in South Korea and in East Asia in general, and for peace and reconciliation with North Korea in particular\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/762> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\u201Dfor hans arbeid for demokrati og menneskerettigheter i\r\nS\u00F8r-Korea og \u00D8st-Asia generelt og for fred og forsoning\r\nspesielt med Nord-Korea\u201D"@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/782> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for their work for a better organized and more peaceful world\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/782> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\u201Dfor deres innsats for en bedre organisert og fredeligare\r\nverden\u201D"@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/783> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for their work for a better organized and more peaceful world\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/783> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\u201Dfor deres innsats for en bedre organisert og fredeligare\r\nverden\u201D"@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/796> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his decades of untiring effort to find peaceful solutions to international conflicts, to advance democracy and human rights, and to promote economic and social development\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/796> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\u201Dfor hans iherdige innsats gjennom flere ti\u00E5r for fredelig\r\nl\u00F6sning av internasjonale konflikter, for demokrati og\r\nmenneskerettigheter og for \u00F6konomisk og sosial utvikling\u201D"@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/807> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for her efforts for democracy and human rights. She has focused especially on the struggle for the rights of women and children\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/807> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\u201Dfor hennar innsats for demokrati og menneskerettar. Ho har saerleg engasjert seg i kampen for rettane til kvinner og born\u201D"@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/817> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for her contribution to sustainable development, democracy and peace\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/817> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\u201Dfor hennar innsats for ei berekraftig utvikling, demokrati og fred\u201D"@sv .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/831> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for their efforts to prevent nuclear energy from being used for military purposes and to ensure that nuclear energy for peaceful purposes is used in the safest possible way\""@en .
