<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/853> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for their efforts to build up and disseminate greater knowledge about man-made climate change, and to lay the foundations for the measures that are needed to counteract such change\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/867> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his important efforts, on several continents and over more than three decades, to resolve international conflicts\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/879> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his extraordinary efforts to strengthen international diplomacy and cooperation between peoples\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/895> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for his long and non-violent struggle for fundamental human rights in China\""@en .
<http://data.nobelprize.org/resource/laureateaward/915> <http://data.nobelprize.org/terms/motivation> "\"for their non-violent struggle for the safety of women and for women&apos;s rights to full participation in peace-building work\""@en .
